			"route": "/conferences/book",
			"type": "custom",
			"title": "Book a conversation",
			"component": "BookConferenceSlotsView",
			"_note": "The guardian/self conversation-slot picker (the 'custom view only where a manifest page can't render it' exception): a genuine calendar-grid UI over teacher availability, not a generic CRUD form. Lists booking-open ConferenceRounds the caller can book into, shows each requested teacher's remaining availability, creates a ConferenceSignup (draft) and triggers its submit transition (gated server-side by ConferenceSignupGuardianGuard)."
		},
		{
