			"type": "custom",
			"title": "Conference schedule board",
			"component": "ConferenceScheduleBoard",
			"_note": "The coordinator's manual-override board (the 'custom view only where a manifest page can't render it' exception): lists waitlisted ConferenceSignups per round with the unmet teacher-request, a manual ConferenceSlot creation action, and a regenerate trigger. ConferenceScheduleGenerator (server-side) runs the greedy solver when regenerate fires."
